\b Smart Attendance System - Codebase Report\b0\par
Generated: 2026-05-24 22:51:30 +05:30\par
\par
\b Overview\b0\par
This codebase implements a computer vision attendance system. A Tkinter desktop app handles enrollment and live recognition. Attendance is stored in a single Excel workbook. A Streamlit dashboard reads the same workbook for analytics, exports, and admin actions. Face detection uses YOLOv8, and recognition uses OpenCV LBPH with vote smoothing for stability. Optional MediaPipe face mesh overlays are drawn for visual feedback.\par
\par
\b Tech Stack (and why it is used)\b0\par
- Python 3.8+ as the application runtime.\par
- OpenCV (opencv-contrib-python) for image processing and LBPH face recognition.\par
- Ultralytics YOLOv8 for real-time face detection.\par
- MediaPipe for optional face-landmarker mesh overlays.\par
- NumPy for array and image math.\par
- Pillow (PIL) for Tkinter image conversion.\par
- OpenPyXL for Excel read/write and styling.\par
- Matplotlib for generating the attendance popup chart.\par
- Streamlit for the admin dashboard UI.\par
- Pandas for attendance dataframes in the dashboard.\par
- Plotly for interactive charts in the dashboard.\par
- FPDF (scripts) for generating a PDF report.\par
\par
\b Architecture (high level)\b0\par
1. Enrollment pipeline\par
- FaceDetector locates a single face in a webcam frame.\par
- FaceEncoder normalizes (CLAHE), augments images, and trains an LBPH model.\par
- Label map and model files are persisted in encodings\\.\par
\par
2. Attendance pipeline\par
- FaceDetector finds faces.\par
- FaceRecognizer crops and normalizes faces, predicts LBPH labels, and vote-smooths across frames.\par
- AttendanceLogger records unique daily marks to attendance_records\\attendance_records.xlsx.\par
- Attendance popup shows the student history and a chart.\par
\par
3. Admin dashboard\par
- Streamlit dashboard reads the same Excel workbook and label map.\par
- Provides daily reports, student stats, exports, and data cleanup utilities.\par
\par
\b Data storage and artifacts\b0\par
- known_faces\\ : Per-student directories with raw and augmented face images.\par
- encodings\\ : LBPH model and label map pickle.\par
- attendance_records\\attendance_records.xlsx : Master attendance workbook.\par
- models\\ : YOLOv8 face model and MediaPipe face landmarker task file.\par
\par
\b Module and Function Explanations (simplified)\b0\par
\par
\b config.py\b0\par
Purpose: Central configuration for paths, thresholds, camera index, performance flags, and UI colors.\par
Key settings explain where files are stored (known_faces, encodings, attendance_records, models) and how strict recognition is (LBPH_THRESHOLD, MIN_ATTENDANCE_CONFIDENCE).\par
\par
\b attendance_logger.py\b0\par
Purpose: Single source of truth for attendance persistence in Excel.\par
Functions:\par
- _thin_border: Returns a thin border style for Excel cells.\par
- _header_style: Returns font, fill, and alignment used for header cells.\par
- _data_style: Returns alignment and fill for data rows.\par
Class AttendanceLogger:\par
- __init__: Sets file paths, loads or creates the workbook, preloads today, starts autosave.\par
- _create_new_workbook: Creates the workbook with styled header row.\par
- date_str: Property that always returns today in YYYY-MM-DD.\par
- _check_date_rollover: Resets cache if the date changes during runtime.\par
- _load_todays_marks: Reads the workbook to rebuild today cache on startup.\par
- mark_present: Adds a student to the in-memory cache if not already marked today.\par
- is_already_marked: Checks if a student was already marked today.\par
- get_present_list: Returns current-session present list from cache.\par
- _flush_to_sheet: Writes cached records to the Excel sheet.\par
- _autosave_loop: Background thread that periodically saves to disk.\par
- get_summary: Returns total present and file path summary.\par
- save: Flushes and saves the workbook immediately.\par
- close: Flushes, saves, and stops autosave.\par
Function get_student_history:\par
- Reads the workbook and computes total, present, absent days and percentage for a student.\par
\par
\b face_detector.py\b0\par
Purpose: YOLOv8-based face detection with auto model download.\par
Class FaceDetector:\par
- __init__: Ensures model exists and loads YOLO once.\par
- _ensure_model: Downloads the YOLO model if missing.\par
- detect: Returns face bounding boxes for a frame.\par
- detect_with_confidence: Returns bounding boxes with confidence scores.\par
\par
\b face_encoder.py\b0\par
Purpose: Enrollment and LBPH training pipeline with augmentation.\par
Functions:\par
- _sanitize_path_component: Cleans names for safe folder paths.\par
- _augment_face: Generates augmented face crops (flip, brightness, contrast, gamma, blur).\par
- _apply_gamma: Applies gamma correction to a grayscale image (inner helper).\par
- enroll_from_gui: Detects a single face and returns a normalized 200x200 grayscale crop.\par
- save_enrollment: Saves images, updates label map, retrains LBPH model.\par
- _report: Inner helper to push status to the UI callback.\par
- _train_lbph_model: Loads all face images, applies CLAHE, trains LBPH, saves model.\par
- _load_label_map: Loads the label map pickle from disk.\par
- _save_label_map: Saves the label map pickle to disk.\par
- load_all_encodings: Returns the label map for recognition.\par
- delete_student: Removes a student data folder and retrains or removes the model.\par
- get_enrolled_students: Returns a list of enrolled student name and roll.\par
\par
\b face_recognizer.py\b0\par
Purpose: Live recognition and overlay drawing.\par
Class FaceRecognizer:\par
- __init__: Loads detector, LBPH model, sets up vote buffers and lazy MediaPipe init.\par
- reload_model: Reloads LBPH model and label map from disk.\par
- _init_landmarker: Downloads and initializes MediaPipe face landmarker in background.\par
- recognize_frame: Detects faces, runs LBPH prediction, and vote-smooths results.\par
- _draw_corner_brackets: Draws futuristic corner brackets for a face box.\par
- _draw_scan_line: Draws a scanning line animation across a face box.\par
- _draw_confidence_bar: Draws a confidence bar above the face.\par
- _draw_hud_label: Draws a label and confidence summary below the face.\par
- _draw_face_mesh: Draws a face mesh overlay when enabled.\par
- _draw_fps: Draws live FPS in the top-right corner.\par
- draw_results: High-level helper to render all overlays for current recognition results.\par
- num_enrolled: Returns how many students are enrolled (from label map).\par
\par
